  ! #328: "which upgrades the OpenAI SDK to 2.14.0 to fix a TypeLoadException on tool-carrying Responses API calls and a streaming crash against third-party OpenAI-compatible endpoints" - The upgrade and the fixes are from the upstream release notes of Microsoft.Extensions.AI.OpenAI 10.10.1. Chartula's own PR only bumps the dependency version; it did not itself fix these issues.
